Did you figure out/n
who the culprit is?#q1#
[wait time=3000]
[endballoon name=cinnamon]
[waitaction name=cinnamon script=tefuri_set2]

[movecamera type=0 x=-0.5 y=2.5 z=8.5 time=0]
[rotatecamera pitch=5 head=160 time=0]

